---

nuGreeC is an independent implementation of the Gree local network protocol.
It contains no code from any other project. The protocol itself - packet
layout, field names, and the fixed key material every Gree module ships with -
is factual interoperability information, documented publicly by the
reverse-engineering work credited in README.md.

Attribution for that prior work is given in README.md under "Credits". Note
that two of the projects credited there (tomikaa87/gree-remote and
cmroche/greeclimate) are GPL-licensed; they were used as protocol
documentation, not as a source of code.

The AES S-box and inverse S-box in src/gree_crypto.c were generated
programmatically from the algebraic definition in FIPS PUB 197, not copied
from another implementation.

